---
title: Test - Artifact Browse Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant WEB as Web UI
    participant AAPI as Artifact API
    participant ARTIFACTS as Project Artifacts

    Dev->>WEB: Opens artifact sidebar
    WEB->>AAPI: GET /artifacts?project_path=...
    Note right of AAPI: assert project_path exists on filesystem
    Note right of AAPI: assert missing .dingllm/ returns empty list, not error

    AAPI->>ARTIFACTS: Read .dingllm/ directory tree
    ARTIFACTS-->>AAPI: File list
    Note right of AAPI: assert response is list of ArtifactEntry
    Note right of AAPI: assert each entry has name, path, type (non-empty str)
    Note right of AAPI: assert only approved types returned: md, mmd, txt
    Note right of AAPI: assert files with other extensions are excluded
    Note right of AAPI: assert entries match actual files in .dingllm/ tree
    Note right of AAPI: assert empty .dingllm/ returns empty list
    Note right of AAPI: assert nonexistent project_path returns error

    AAPI-->>WEB: list[ArtifactEntry]
    WEB-->>Dev: Shows file list in sidebar

    Dev->>WEB: Clicks on a diagram filename
    WEB->>AAPI: GET /artifacts/{path}?project_path=...
    Note right of AAPI: assert rel_path is within project_path
    Note right of AAPI: assert path traversal (../../) returns error
    Note right of AAPI: assert rel_path is a file, not a directory

    AAPI->>ARTIFACTS: Read .mmd file from project repo
    ARTIFACTS-->>AAPI: Mermaid source
    Note right of AAPI: assert nonexistent rel_path returns error

    AAPI-->>WEB: str (artifact content)
    Note right of WEB: assert response is str
    WEB-->>Dev: Renders diagram in canvas
